  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Households in target communities will achieve food security and improved nutrition through increasing production and food preservation. Training of families in production (crop cycles, biotechnologies, good practices (climate robust and sustainable agriculture and livestock production) and in nutriton (production for self-consuption, diet, etc).  Special attention 
will be given to the participation of women, youth and persons living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
